# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day32

I remember when I went on a short trip with my friends a few months ago.

We went to a city near the coast and stayed there for two days.

At first, everything went according to plan, and we spent the afternoon walking around and taking pictures.

Then, it suddenly started raining heavily.

We didn't have umbrellas, so we had to find a nearby cafe.

I was a little disappointed because we had planned to spend more time outside.

However, we ended up having a great time at the cafe.

We talked for a long time and tried some new desserts.

In the end, the unexpected rain actually made the trip more memorable.
